 "description": "地図で見れば日本のすぐ隣。しかし、そこは日本人のほとんどが足を踏み入れることのできない「近くて遠い場所」です。そこには教科書通りの美しい火山や、神の島と呼ばれる絶景が広がっています。なぜこの海域は今、厳重に閉ざされているのか？その歴史と、知られざる現在の姿に迫ります。\n\n参考文献\nCan Russian Strategic Submarines Survive at Sea?\nThe Fundamental Limits of Passive Acoustics\nhttps://scienceandglobalsecurity.org/archive/sgs04miasnikov.pdf\n\nGrowing Tensions within the East Asian Security Environment\nhttps://npi.or.jp/en/research/data/oosawa02.pdf\n\nDevelopment of Russian Armed Forces in the Vicinity of Japan\nhttps://www.mod.go.jp/en/d_act/sec_env/pdf/ru_d-act.pdf\n\nRussia sends missiles near Pacific islands claimed by Japan\nhttps://www.militarytimes.com/flashpoints/2021/12/02/russia-sends-missiles-near-pacific-islands-claimed-by-japan/\n\n千島アイヌの精神世界にみる海への適応\nhttps://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/hoppohmsymposium/10/0/10_019/_pdf/-char/ja\n\nFlowers and Inaw　– Ainu Culture in the World –\nhttps://www.cais.hokudai.ac.jp/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ainu-bookletv9_eng.pdf\n\nTime period determination of the Kuril Ainu’s major with drawal from Kamchatka\nhttps://jjarchaeology.jp/contents/pdf/vol008/8-1_003.pdf\n\nWEST-EUROPEAN, RUSSIAN, AND JAPANESE MAPS OF THE KURIL ISLANDS UP TO THE 19TH CENTURY: A COMPARATIVE ANALYSIS \nhttps://icaci.org/files/documents/ICC_proceedings/ICC2009/html/nonref/14_22.pdf\n\nAhead of Notsuke Peninsula, the entrance to a whole world\nhttps://kai-hokkaido.com/archives/en/feature_vol44_story1/\n\nDescription of the Border Areas of Russia with Japan and Their Inhabitants in Witsen’s\nNorth and East Tartary\nhttps://src-h.slav.hokudai.ac.jp/publictn/acta/24/deGraaf.pdf\n\nSubmarine hydrothermal activity and mineralization on the\nKurile and western Aleutian island arcs, N.W. Pacific\nhttps://repository.geologyscience.ru/bitstream/handle/123456789/47027/Glas_06.pdf\n\n北方領土問題の歴史\nhttps://www.hoppou.go.jp/problem-info/know/islands-history.html\n\n令和3年度　デジタル図録　北方領土関連資料＿地図資料\nhttps://www.hoppou.go.jp/assets/docs/research/r3_rep-05.pdf\n\nThe end of the ‘dual possession’ of Sakhalin as multilateral diplomacy, 1867–73\nhttps://www.academia.edu/26882379/The_end_of_the_dual_possession_of_Sakhalin_as_multilateral_diplomacy_1867_73\n\nThe Northern Territories Question in the Context of the War in Ukraine\nhttps://www.jiia-jic.jp/en/japanreview/pdf/03JapanReview_Vol7_No2_Valerie%20Niquet.pdf\n\nThe middle to Late Holocene environment on the Iturup Island\nhttps://epic.awi.de/id/eprint/59868/1/Nazarova-et-al-2023.pdf\n\nLATE PLEISTOCENE-HOLOCENE CALDERA-FORMING EXPLOSIVE VOLCANISM OF THE GREAT KURIL ARC\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/figure/Examples-of-the-Great-Kuril-Arc-calderas-a-the-Golovnin-Caldera-Kunashir-Island-b_fig1_390963109\n\nPetrology of the 1952 Eruption and Ancient Lava and Pyroclastic Flows of Krenitsyn Peak Volcano, Onekotan Island, Kuril Arc, Russia\nhttps://www.mdpi.com/2076-3263/15/9/358\n\nFriends of the Earth Japan「Saving Russia’s Far Eastern Taiga\nhttps://www.gef.or.jp/activityex/forest/fairwood/book/taiga1999/report/taiga_e2-3.PDF\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRIhixh1D60\n\n\n【お知らせ】\nいつも応援ありがとうございます！\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
